      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Giant coronary artery aneurysm is a rare disorder which remains asymptomatic in most patients. However it appears that serious complications may develop at some point of time and will likely require surgical intervention. A patient with a huge coronary aneurysm ten centimeters in diameter successfully treated with surgical intervention was presented."},
